.TH vcs 1 "" "vcs 2.0.0"
.SH NAME
vcs \- A version control tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvcs\fR [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR \fIDIRECTORY\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fICOMMAND\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A version control tool
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print less output
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR=\fIDIRECTORY\fR
Working directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\fBvcs commit\fR
Commit changes
.br
\fBvcs commit\fR [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-message\fR \fIMESSAGE\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR \fICOLOR\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR]
.TP
\fBvcs remote\fR
Manage remotes
.br
\fBvcs remote\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] <\fICOMMAND\fR>
.TP
\fBvcs remote add\fR
Add a remote
.br
\fBvcs remote add\fR [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-protocol\fR \fIPROTOCOL\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] <\fINAME\fR>
.TP
\fBvcs remote remove\fR
Remove a remote
.br
[aliases: rm]
.br
\fBvcs remote remove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] <\fINAME\fR>
.TP
\fBvcs remote show\fR
Show a remote
.br
\fBvcs remote show\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fINAME\fR]
.SH VERSION
v2.0.0
